    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh, you are here. It feels good to finish the appraisal fast. Thanks to you, I have secured a lot of good items."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Come on, there is no time for a rest. Let's collect the next item. It's going to the last item. Go get  [Perfect Goat Horn] of [Satyros]. It's the most expensive item of this area!\n\nSujiphae a complete goat horns from Satyr at the request of the Appraisers of Goods Eslant updated Deeds expected."

